en more damage.<br>Salvage your resources to use in the trader to buy upgrades.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To develop the game alongside the community so it becomes a game that everyone loving the clicker genre can enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
